<title>CZECH REPUBLIC: Czech cbank sets 2wk rev repo at 16 pct.</title>
<headline>Czech cbank sets 2wk rev repo at 16 pct.</headline>
<dateline>PRAGUE 1997-07-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Czech National Bank (CNB) on Monday set a two-week reverse repo tender to drain funds with the limit rate unchanged at 16 percent.</p>
<p>Up to two bids will be accepted in the Amercian style operation at a minimum of 100 million crowns each.</p>
<p>tHE Average yield in the last such auction on July 16 was 16.0 percent.</p>
<p>Earlier on Monday the CNB set a one-week repo tender at 16.0 percent.</p>
<p>-- Robin Shepherd, Prague Newsroom, 420-2-2423-0003</p>
